  },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "description": "Guia de leitura para investigacao da camada de negocio.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Como interpretar este dashboard\n- Aqui o foco nao e a rota HTTP, e sim a operacao de negocio.\n- **Execution Rate** mostra volume de execucao.\n- **Success Rate** e **Error Rate** mostram qualidade da operacao.\n- **Use Case P95** mostra custo medio alto da regra de negocio, mesmo quando a API continua respondendo.\n- Se o caso de uso estiver lento, abra logs e traces para ver a sequencia exata da execucao.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Como Ler Casos De Uso",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Execucoes por segundo do caso de uso filtrado. Use para saber se a operacao esta sob carga ou falhando em baixa escala.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(designsoftddd_use_case_executions_total{app_use_case=~\"$use_case\",app_resource=~\"$resource\",app_action=~\"$action\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Execution Rate",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Percentual de sucesso do caso de uso filtrado. Se cair, algo no fluxo de negocio esta degradando.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(designsoftddd_use_case_executions_total{app_use_case=~\"$use_case\",app_resource=~\"$resource\",app_action=~\"$action\",app_outcome=\"success\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(designsoftddd_use_case_executions_total{app_use_case=~\"$use_case\",app_resource=~\"$resource\",app_action=~\"$action\"}[$__rate_interval])), 0.000001))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Success Rate",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Percentual de falha do caso de uso filtrado. Qualquer aumento sustentado aqui deve aparecer tambem nos logs estruturados.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(designsoftddd_use_case_executions_total{app_use_case=~\"$use_case\",app_resource=~\"$resource\",app_action=~\"$action\",app_outcome=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(designsoftddd_use_case_executions_total{app_use_case=~\"$use_case\",app_resource=~\"$resource\",app_action=~\"$action\"}[$__rate_interval])), 0.000001))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Error Rate",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Tempo do percentil 95 da operacao de negocio. Se ele sobe e o HTTP nao sobe junto, ha custo interno oculto no fluxo.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 3,
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(designsoftddd_use_case_duration_seconds_bucket{app_use_case=~\"$use_case\",app_resource=~\"$resource\",app_action=~\"$action\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Use Case P95",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Volume ao longo do tempo separado entre sucesso e erro. Serve para ver se a falha apareceu em pico ou de forma continua.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (app_outcome) (rate(designsoftddd_use_case_executions_total{app_use_case=~\"$use_case\",app_resource=~\"$resource\",app_action=~\"$action\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app_outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Executions by Outcome",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Comparacao entre p50, p95 e p99 do caso de uso. Distancia grande entre p95 e p99 indica poucos fluxos muito caros.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(designsoftddd_use_case_duration_seconds_bucket{app_use_case=~\"$use_case\",app_resource=~\"$resource\",app_action=~\"$action\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(designsoftddd_use_case_duration_seconds_bucket{app_use_case=~\"$use_case\",app_resource=~\"$resource\",app_action=~\"$action\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(designsoftddd_use_case_duration_seconds_bucket{app_use_case=~\"$use_case\",app_resource=~\"$resource\",app_action=~\"$action\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Use Case Duration Quantiles",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Mostra quais rotas estao acionando o caso de uso. Quando novas rotas surgirem, elas aparecerao aqui automaticamente.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (http_route) (rate(designsoftddd_use_case_executions_total{app_use_case=~\"$use_case\",app_resource=~\"$resource\",app_action=~\"$action\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Routes Executing This Use Case",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "description": "Lista os casos de uso mais lentos por p95. Bom painel para priorizar tuning quando houver muitos fluxos monitorados.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18
      },
      "id": 9,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, app_use_case) (rate(designsoftddd_use_case_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval]))))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app_use_case}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Slowest Use Cases (P95)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "description": "Logs estruturados do caso de uso filtrado. Procure por `app_outcome=error` para encontrar falhas de negocio.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{service_name=\"rocketseat-ddd-api\"} |= \"Use case\" |~ \"$use_case\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Use Case Logs",
      "type": "logs"
    },
    {
      "description": "Como sair do painel de negocio e abrir o fluxo completo no Tempo.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 26
      },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Quando abrir traces deste caso de uso\n- Abra o Tempo quando **Error Rate** sair de zero ou quando **Use Case P95** subir sem motivo claro.\n- No Explore, use `{ resource.service.name = \"rocketseat-ddd-api\" }` e foque em spans com `name = \"$use_case\"`.\n- Use o `trace_id` dos logs para cair no fluxo exato com menos tentativa e erro.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Trace Playbook",
      "type": "text"
    }
  ],
